# Frontend — Testing (Unit / Integration / E2E)

Created: 2026-02-02 05:37 UTC  
Last reviewed: 2026-02-02 05:37 UTC

## Test Levels
- **Unit**: pure functions, hooks, reducers
- **Component**: UI interactions, mocked network
- **E2E**: real browser flows with a realistic backend/mocks

## Example Commands
```sh
pnpm test
pnpm test -- --watch
pnpm test:e2e
```

## Patterns That Work
- Prefer testing user-visible behavior over implementation details.
- For async UI, assert on the final state (“spinner disappears”, “error shown”).
- Add one regression test per bugfix (minimum).

## Common Failure Modes
- Tests relying on real time → use fake timers where appropriate
- Flaky network mocks → centralize mock helpers
- Non-deterministic selectors → use accessibility roles/labels

